       2005-CONSULTAR-CENTIDAD.
      ***************************************************************

           EVALUATE X372M006-CENTIDAD-S(XN-J)
                WHEN '10'
                      SET SI-MAPFRE    TO TRUE
                WHEN '20'
                      SET SI-CMADRID   TO TRUE
                WHEN '60'
                      SET SI-BANKINTER TO TRUE
           END-EVALUATE.

      ***************************************************************
       2010-CONSULTAR-AGENDA.
      ***************************************************************

           INITIALIZE WS-X362M007.
           MOVE 'S1'                        TO X362M007-OPERACION-E
           MOVE 'V2'                        TO  X362M007-CTIPOINFORME-E

           CALL WS-B362M007 USING WS-X362M007

           IF X362M007-CRETORNO-S EQUAL '00'

              MOVE X362M007-GCRITERIO1-S
                TO WS-CRITERIOS1

              MOVE X362M007-KPETINFORME-S TO WS-KPETINFORME

           ELSE
              IF X362M007-CRETORNO-S EQUAL '03'
                 SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE
                 PERFORM 2012-ERR-FALTA-PETICIONES

                 ELSE
                    SET SI-ROLLBACK TO TRUE
                    SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE
                    PERFORM 2011-ERR-CONSULTAR-INFORME
              END-IF
            END-IF
              .
      *****************************************************************
      * 2011-ERR-CONSULTAR-INFORME.                                   *
      *****************************************************************

       2011-ERR-CONSULTAR-INFORME.
           INITIALIZE WS-REG-ERR.

           MOVE WS-B362M007
             TO WS-GPROGRAMA.

           MOVE '2010-CONSULTAR-AGENDA'
             TO WS-NPARRAFO.

           MOVE X362M007-SQLCODE-S
             TO WS-SQLCODE.

           MOVE X362M007-GCRITERIO1-S
             TO WS-GDATOS.

           MOVE '336'      TO WS-CINCIDENCIA
           MOVE 'ERROR AL CONSULTAR INFORMES Y DE AGENDA'
             TO WS-GINCIDENCIA

           PERFORM 2510-WRITE-REG-ERR.

      *****************************************************************
      * 2012-ERR-FALTA-PETICIONES.                                   *
      *****************************************************************

        2012-ERR-FALTA-PETICIONES.
           INITIALIZE WS-REG-ERR.

           MOVE WS-B362M007
             TO WS-GPROGRAMA.

           MOVE '2010-CONSULTAR-AGENDA'
             TO WS-NPARRAFO.

           MOVE X362M007-SQLCODE-S
             TO WS-SQLCODE.

           MOVE X362M007-GCRITERIO1-S
             TO WS-GDATOS.

           MOVE '336'      TO WS-CINCIDENCIA.
           MOVE 'NO EXISTE REGISTROS EN LA TABLA DE PETICIONES'
             TO WS-GINCIDENCIA.

           PERFORM 2510-WRITE-REG-ERR.

      ***************************************************************
       2020-ACTUALIZAR-AGENDA.
      ***************************************************************

           INITIALIZE WS-X362M007.
           MOVE 'D1'                        TO X362M007-OPERACION-E
           MOVE 'V2'                        TO  X362M007-CTIPOINFORME-E
           MOVE WS-KPETINFORME              TO X362M007-KPETINFORME-E

           CALL WS-B362M007 USING WS-X362M007

           IF X362M007-CRETORNO-S  NOT EQUAL '00'
              SET SI-ROLLBACK TO TRUE
              SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE
              PERFORM 2021-ERR-ACT-ESTADO-AGENDA
           END-IF
              .

      *****************************************************************
       2021-ERR-ACT-ESTADO-AGENDA.
      *****************************************************************
           INITIALIZE WS-REG-ERR

           MOVE WS-B362M007
             TO WS-GPROGRAMA.

           MOVE '2020-ACTUALIZAR-AGENDA'
             TO WS-NPARRAFO.

           MOVE X362M007-SQLCODE-S
             TO WS-SQLCODE.

           MOVE X362M007-GCRITERIO1-S
             TO WS-GDATOS.

           MOVE '336'      TO WS-CINCIDENCIA
           MOVE 'ERROR AL CONSULTAR PROCESOS DE AGENDA'
             TO WS-GINCIDENCIA

           PERFORM 2510-WRITE-REG-ERR.

      *****************************************************************
       2031-ERR-MODULO-CONSULTA.
      *****************************************************************
           INITIALIZE WS-REG-ERR

           MOVE WS-B372M006
             TO WS-GPROGRAMA.

           MOVE '2020-ACTUALIZAR-AGENDA'
             TO WS-NPARRAFO.

           MOVE X362M007-SQLCODE-S
             TO WS-SQLCODE.

           MOVE X362M007-GCRITERIO1-S
             TO WS-GDATOS.

           MOVE '336'      TO WS-CINCIDENCIA
           MOVE 'ERROR AL CONSULTAR EXPEDIENTES'
             TO WS-GINCIDENCIA

           PERFORM 2510-WRITE-REG-ERR.


      ***************************************************************
       2099-ERR-NO-REG-ENCONTRADOS.
      ***************************************************************
           INITIALIZE WS-REG-ERR

           MOVE NOMBRE-CADENA        TO CB-CADENA.
           MOVE 'ERRORES POR RENDIMIENTO TRABAJO'
             TO CB-FICHERO.
           MOVE WS-BUZON    TO CB-BUZON.

           IF NOT SI-MAPFRE
              MOVE '10'       TO CB-COMPANIA
              WRITE REG-ERR  FROM CAB-0
MMC                              AFTER ADVANCING PAGE
              MOVE '336'      TO WS-CINCIDENCIA
              MOVE 'NO HAY EXPEDIENTES QUE CUMPLAN LOS CRITERIOS SELECCIONA
      -            'DOS'
                TO WS-GINCIDENCIA
              PERFORM  2500-WRITE-REG-ERR
           END-IF


           IF NOT SI-CMADRID
              MOVE '20'       TO CB-COMPANIA
              WRITE REG-ERR  FROM CAB-0
MMC                              AFTER ADVANCING PAGE
              MOVE '336'      TO WS-CINCIDENCIA
              MOVE 'NO HAY EXPEDIENTES QUE CUMPLAN LOS CRITERIOS SELECCIONA
      -            'DOS'
                TO WS-GINCIDENCIA
              PERFORM  2500-WRITE-REG-ERR
           END-IF


           IF NOT SI-BANKINTER
              MOVE '60'        TO CB-COMPANIA
              WRITE REG-ERR  FROM CAB-0
MMC                              AFTER ADVANCING PAGE
              MOVE '336'      TO WS-CINCIDENCIA
              MOVE 'NO HAY EXPEDIENTES QUE CUMPLAN LOS CRITERIOS SELECCIONA
      -            'DOS'
                TO WS-GINCIDENCIA
              PERFORM  2500-WRITE-REG-ERR
           END-IF.

      ***************************************************************
       2100-MOVER-ENTRADA-LISTADO.
      ***************************************************************

           MOVE CT-TIPOPERACION            TO X372M006-OPERACION-E
           MOVE WS-FECPAGDESDE             TO X372M006-FECHADESDE-E
           MOVE WS-FECPAGHASTA             TO X372M006-FECHAHASTA-E
           MOVE X372M006-PRO-ANO-S         TO X372M006-ANT-ANO-E
           MOVE X372M006-PRO-CENTIDAD-S    TO X372M006-ANT-CENTIDAD-E
           MOVE X372M006-PRO-KEXPEDIENTE-S TO X372M006-ANT-KEXPEDIENTE-E

           .
      ***************************************************************
       2200-ESCRIBIR-LINEA.
      ***************************************************************

      *
      **** IMPRESION DE LOS VALORES
      *

           PERFORM VARYING XN-J FROM 1 BY 1
                     UNTIL XN-J > X372M006-NUM-REGISTROS-S
                        OR XN-J > CN-RES-MAX

           PERFORM 2005-CONSULTAR-CENTIDAD

             IF X372M006-CENTIDAD-S(XN-J) NOT EQUAL WS-ANT-CENTIDAD
                MOVE X372M006-CENTIDAD-S(XN-J) TO WS-ANT-CENTIDAD
                IF SW-SI-PRIMERA-VEZ
                   SET SW-NO-PRIMERA-VEZ TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 8100-CABECERA-BUZON
                ELSE
                   PERFORM 2300-MOVER-TOTALES
                   PERFORM 2400-IMPRIMIR-TOTALES
                   PERFORM 8100-CABECERA-BUZON
                   PERFORM 2210-IMPRIMIR-INTRO
                   MOVE 1 TO CT-PAGE
                   MOVE 1 TO CT-LINEA
                   PERFORM 2220-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-1
                   PERFORM 2240-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-3
                   PERFORM 2230-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-2
                   INITIALIZE TOTALES LIN-DETALLE-TOTAL
                END-IF
             END-IF

              MOVE X372M006-ANIO-S            (XN-J)TO DE-ANIO
              MOVE X372M006-KEXPEDIENTE-S     (XN-J)TO DE-EXPED
              MOVE X372M006-KRAMO-S           (XN-J)TO DE-RAMO
              MOVE X372M006-ANIOPOL-S         (XN-J)TO DE-ANIOPOL
              MOVE X372M006-KPOLIZA-S         (XN-J)TO DE-POLIZA
              IF X372M006-FECPAGOCAPITAL-S(XN-J) NOT EQUAL SPACES OR
                                                 NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                 MOVE X372M006-IMPRTOINTEGRCAP-S (XN-J)TO DE-CAP-RTO-INT
                 MOVE X372M006-IMPRTONETOCAP-S   (XN-J)TO DE-CAP-RTO-NET
                 MOVE X372M006-IMPRETCAP-S       (XN-J)TO DE-CAP-RTO
              END-IF
              IF  X372M006-FECPAGCOMP1-S(XN-J) NOT EQUAL SPACES OR
                                               NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                 MOVE X372M006-IMPRTOINTCOMP1-S (XN-J)TO DE-COM1-RTO-INT
                 MOVE X372M006-IRTONETCOMP1-S   (XN-J)TO DE-COM1-RTO-NET
                 MOVE X372M006-IRETCOMP1-S      (XN-J)TO DE-COM1-RTO
              END-IF
              IF  X372M006-FECPAGCOMP2-S(XN-J) NOT EQUAL SPACES OR
                                               NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                 MOVE X372M006-IMPRTOINTCOMP2-S (XN-J)TO DE-COM2-RTO-INT
                 MOVE X372M006-IRTONETCOMP2-S   (XN-J)TO DE-COM2-RTO-NET
                 MOVE X372M006-IRETCOMP2-S      (XN-J)TO DE-COM2-RTO
              END-IF

                 PERFORM 2250-SUMA-TOTALES
              IF CT-LINEA EQUAL 0 OR CT-LINEA > 58
                 MOVE 0 TO CT-LINEA
                 PERFORM 2210-IMPRIMIR-INTRO
                 PERFORM 2220-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-1
                 PERFORM 2240-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-3
                 PERFORM 2230-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-2
                 ADD 1 TO CT-PAGE
              END-IF

      * IMPRIMIR-LINEA-DETALLE.
                 MOVE LIN-DETALLE TO RIMPRESO
                 WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
                 ADD   1  TO  CT-LINEA
      *** CONTROLAMOS SI HAY PAGINACION

              IF XN-J >= CN-RES-MAX
                 MOVE 'S'
                   TO X372M006-SPAGINACION-S
                 MOVE X372M006-ANIO-S         (XN-J)
                   TO X372M006-PRO-ANO-S
                 MOVE X372M006-KEXPEDIENTE-S  (XN-J)
                   TO X372M006-PRO-KEXPEDIENTE-S
              ELSE
                  MOVE 'N'
                   TO X372M006-SPAGINACION-S
              END-IF


           END-PERFORM

               .

       2210-IMPRIMIR-INTRO.
      *********************
           MOVE CT-PAGE TO CB-INTRO-PAG.

           MOVE CAB-INTRO   TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.
           MOVE CAB-INTRO-1 TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.
           MOVE CAB-INTRO-2 TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.
           MOVE LINEA-BLANCO TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.

       2220-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-1.
      *****************
           MOVE X372M006-FECHADESDE-E(1:4) TO CAB-DA
           MOVE X372M006-FECHADESDE-E(5:2) TO CAB-DM
           MOVE X372M006-FECHADESDE-E(7:2) TO CAB-DD

           MOVE X372M006-FECHAHASTA-E(1:4) TO CAB-HA
           MOVE X372M006-FECHAHASTA-E(5:2) TO CAB-HM
           MOVE X372M006-FECHAHASTA-E(7:2) TO CAB-HD

           MOVE CAB-TITULO-1 TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.
           MOVE CAB-TITULO-1-SUBRAYADO TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.
           MOVE CAB-TITULO-1-SUBTITULO TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.
           MOVE LINEA-BLANCO TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.

       2230-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-2.
      *****************
           MOVE CAB-TITULO-2 TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.
           MOVE CAB-TITULO-2-SUBRAYADO TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.

       2240-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-3.
      *****************
           MOVE CAB-TITULO-3 TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.
           MOVE CAB-TITULO-3-SUBRAYADO TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.

        2250-SUMA-TOTALES.
      **********************
      * SUMA PARA LOS TOTALES
           ADD   1  TO  DE-TOTAL-POLIZA
           ADD X372M006-IMPRTOINTEGRCAP-S(XN-J) TO CAP-INT-TO
           ADD X372M006-IMPRTONETOCAP-S(XN-J)   TO CAP-NET-TO
           ADD X372M006-IMPRETCAP-S    (XN-J)   TO CAP-RET-TO

           ADD X372M006-IMPRTOINTCOMP1-S(XN-J) TO COM1-INT-TO
           ADD X372M006-IRTONETCOMP1-S  (XN-J) TO COM1-NET-TO
           ADD X372M006-IRETCOMP1-S     (XN-J) TO COM1-RET-TO

           ADD X372M006-IMPRTOINTCOMP2-S(XN-J) TO COM2-INT-TO
           ADD X372M006-IRTONETCOMP2-S  (XN-J) TO COM2-NET-TO
           ADD X372M006-IRETCOMP2-S     (XN-J) TO COM2-RET-TO
              .

       2300-MOVER-TOTALES.
      ********************
      * MOVEMOS LOS TOTALES A LAS MASCARAS
           MOVE CAP-INT-TO     TO DE-CAP-RTO-INT-TO
           MOVE CAP-NET-TO     TO DE-CAP-RTO-NET-TO
           MOVE CAP-RET-TO     TO DE-CAP-RTO-TO

           MOVE COM1-INT-TO    TO DE-COM1-RTO-INT-TO
           MOVE COM1-NET-TO    TO DE-COM1-RTO-NET-TO
           MOVE COM1-RET-TO    TO DE-COM1-RTO-TO

           MOVE COM2-INT-TO    TO DE-COM2-RTO-INT-TO
           MOVE COM2-NET-TO    TO DE-COM2-RTO-NET-TO
           MOVE COM2-RET-TO    TO DE-COM2-RTO-TO
              .

       2400-IMPRIMIR-TOTALES.
      *****************
           MOVE LIN-DETALLE-TOTAL-SUBRAYADO TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.
           MOVE LIN-DETALLE-TOTAL TO RIMPRESO.
           WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA.

      * CALCULO PARA PASAR LA PAGINA
           SUBTRACT CT-LINEA FROM 59 GIVING AUX-LINEA
           INITIALIZE XN-K
           PERFORM VARYING XN-K FROM 1 BY 1
                    UNTIL XN-K > AUX-LINEA

                     MOVE LINEA-BLANCO TO RIMPRESO
                     WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES
                     ADD 1 TO CT-LINEA
           END-PERFORM
            .

      *****************************************************************
      * 2500-WRITE-REG-ERR.                                           *
      *****************************************************************

       2500-WRITE-REG-ERR.
           WRITE REG-ERR FROM WS-REG-ERR.

      *****************************************************************
      * 2510-WRITE-REG-ERR.                                           *
      *****************************************************************

       2510-WRITE-REG-ERR.
           MOVE NOMBRE-CADENA        TO CB-CADENA.
           MOVE 'ERRORES POR RENDIMIENTO TRABAJO'
             TO CB-FICHERO.
           MOVE WS-BUZON    TO CB-BUZON.

           MOVE '10'       TO CB-COMPANIA
           WRITE REG-ERR  FROM CAB-0
MMC                              AFTER ADVANCING PAGE
           WRITE REG-ERR FROM WS-REG-ERR.

           MOVE '20'       TO CB-COMPANIA
           WRITE REG-ERR  FROM CAB-0
MMC                              AFTER ADVANCING PAGE
           WRITE REG-ERR FROM WS-REG-ERR.

           MOVE '60'       TO CB-COMPANIA
           WRITE REG-ERR  FROM CAB-0
MMC                              AFTER ADVANCING PAGE
           WRITE REG-ERR FROM WS-REG-ERR.

      ******************************************************************
       8100-CABECERA-BUZON.
      ******************************************************************
           INITIALIZE CAB-0

           MOVE WS-ANT-CENTIDAD(1:2) TO CB-COMPANIA.
           MOVE NOMBRE-CADENA        TO CB-CADENA.
           MOVE 'INFORME POR RENDIMIENTO TRABAJO'
             TO CB-FICHERO.

           MOVE WS-BUZON             TO CB-BUZON

           WRITE RIMPRESO FROM CAB-0
MMC                              AFTER ADVANCING PAGE.
      ******************************************************************
        8888-ROLLBACK.
      ******************************************************************

           INITIALIZE WS-X001M001
           MOVE 'R'   TO X001M001-CACCION

           CALL WS-B001M001 USING WS-X001M001.

      *****************************************************************
        8889-COMMIT.
      *****************************************************************
           INITIALIZE WS-X001M001
           MOVE 'C' TO X001M001-CACCION

           CALL WS-B001M001 USING WS-X001M001.

      ***************************************************************
       10000-FIN.
      ***************************************************************

           IF NO-ROLLBACK
              PERFORM 8888-ROLLBACK
           ELSE
              PERFORM 8889-COMMIT
           END-IF

           GOBACK.
